  "On compact laptops the audio codec sits close to the GPU and CPU power stages. Electrical interference and codec power-save clicks are picked up as hiss, buzzing or crackle.\n\nThis profile keeps the HDA codec powered (no power-save pops), runs stable 1024-frame buffers to avoid underruns, and removes steady background noise from the microphone with WebRTC suppression.": "在紧凑型笔记本电脑上，音频编解码器靠近 GPU 和 CPU 功率级。电气干扰和编解码器节电喀哒声会被拾取为嘶嘶声、嗡嗡声或爆裂声。  此配置文件使 HDA 编解​​码器保持供电（无省电弹出声），运行稳定的 1024 帧缓冲区以避免欠载，并通过 WebRTC 抑制消除麦克风中的稳定背景噪音。",
