  "The firewall is applied with nftables as the inet elvonos table and cannot be bypassed by unprivileged processes.\nThe performance service applies the saved profile, ZRAM and firewall state on every boot. Use the Protection tab to\ntemporarily disable the firewall for troubleshooting; the setting persists for the current live session.": "防火墙应用nftables作为inet elvonos表，非特权进程无法绕过。性能服务在每次启动时应用保存的配置文件、ZRAM 和防火墙状态。使用“保护”选项卡暂时禁用防火墙以进行故障排除；该设置在当前实时会话中保留。",
  "The installation log appears here.": "安装日志出现在此处。",
  "The tuning profile is applied by the root helper through passwordless sudo. Balanced uses schedutil (or the closest\navailable governor), enables ZRAM swap and tunes swappiness and cache pressure. The settings are reapplied on every boot\nby elvonos-tune.service. Waydroid protection limits the Android container to 75% of RAM and raises its CPU weight.": "调整配置文件由 root 助手通过无密码 sudo 应用。 Balanced 使用 schedutil（或最接近的可用调控器），启用 ZRAM 交换并调整交换性和缓存压力。每次启动时，elvonos-tune.service 都会重新应用这些设置。 Waydroid 保护将 Android 容器限制为 RAM 的 75%，并增加了其 CPU 权重。",
